%% ADR-245 — Grade Planner multi-dia
%% Sequencia do submit em lote: componente -> helper puro -> N POST -> invalidacao -> toast.
%% Vale para os dois fluxos de criacao da grade: "+" da celula / Novo Torneio e clique no card.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Jogador
    participant Dialog as TournamentFormDialog - modal canonico
    participant Adapter as DayCreateTournamentDialog - adapter da grade
    participant Planner as GradePlanner - fonte de getActiveProfile
    participant Helper as shared/grade-multi-day.ts - puro
    participant API as POST /api/planned-tournaments
    participant Storage as storage.createPlannedTournament
    participant Cache as queryClient
    participant Toast as useToast

    Note over Dialog,Adapter: O state dos dias vive no ADAPTER.<br/>TournamentFormState fica INTOCADO.

    User->>Dialog: Marca chips Qua, Qui, Sex no WeekDaysPicker
    Dialog->>Adapter: extraSlot re-renderiza com selectedDays
    Adapter-->>Dialog: extraCanSubmit = selectedDays.length > 0
    Dialog-->>User: Botao Salvar habilitado

    User->>Dialog: Clica em Salvar
    Dialog->>Adapter: onSubmit(values: TournamentFormState)

    Adapter->>Planner: getActiveProfile injetado como prop
    Adapter->>Helper: resolveMultiDayTargets([3,4,5], getProfileForDay)
    Helper-->>Adapter: targets [{3,'B'}] + skipped [{4,'day_off'},{5,'no_active_profile'}]

    alt targets vazio - todos OFF ou sem perfil
        Adapter->>Toast: toast destructive - Nenhum dia valido
        Adapter-->>Dialog: lanca, com errorMessage controlada pelo adapter
        Dialog-->>User: MODAL CONTINUA ABERTO, nenhum POST disparado
    else targets nao vazio
        loop SEQUENCIAL - 1 iteracao por alvo, max 7
            Adapter->>API: POST payload do dia + profile daquele dia
            API->>Storage: insert planned_tournaments
            Storage-)Storage: ensureLibraryEntryForPlannedSafe - fire-and-forget, sem await
            alt 2xx
                API-->>Adapter: torneio criado
                Adapter->>Adapter: created.push(dayOfWeek)
            else 4xx / 5xx
                API-->>Adapter: erro
                Adapter->>Adapter: failed.push(dayOfWeek) e SEGUE para o proximo alvo
            end
        end

        Note over Adapter,Cache: Invalidacao UMA vez, depois do laco — nunca por item.
        Adapter->>Cache: invalidate /api/planned-tournaments
        Adapter->>Cache: invalidate /api/active-days
        Adapter->>Cache: invalidate /api/tournament-library
        Adapter->>Cache: invalidate day-detail por alvo criado

        Adapter->>Adapter: safeEmit coach.day_zoom_create_save uma unica vez, com daysCount e skippedCount

        Adapter->>Helper: summarizeMultiDayResult({created, failed, skipped}, dayLabels)
        Helper-->>Adapter: { title, description, variant }
        Adapter->>Toast: UM unico toast do lote

        alt houve ao menos 1 sucesso
            Adapter-->>Dialog: retorna normalmente
            Dialog-->>User: Modal fecha; criados permanecem
        else nenhum sucesso - todos falharam
            Adapter-->>Dialog: lanca, com errorMessage controlada pelo adapter
            Dialog-->>User: MODAL CONTINUA ABERTO
        end
    end
